---
description: Turn authorized onboarding goals into measurable customer-owned acceptance outcomes.
args:{goal:GoalContract;policy:PolicySelection;records:Onboarding[];evidence:EvidencePage[]}
returns:OnboardingOutcome[]
---
For every requested result bind a customer owner, observable acceptance condition and explicit in-scope/excluded boundary. Keep aspirational or unapproved outcomes as unresolved questions. Do not let a vendor promise substitute for customer authority.
